OL,3,AOslo mayor calls off wedding ceremony
OL,4,Aafter death of Norway's king
OL,5,
OL,6,FOslo's Mayor Anne Lindboe has called
OL,7,Foff her wedding ceremony because of the
OL,8,Fdeath of Norway's King Harald V.
OL,10,FThe wedding with her fiance Pal Sandvid
OL,11,Fwas planned for Friday but was
OL,12,Fpostponed after the king died early on
OL,13,Fthe same day, her political adviser
OL,14,Fconfirmed to the BBC.
OL,16,F"It's hard to imagine an Oslo and a
OL,17,FNorway without you. You didn't need a
OL,18,Fcrowd to be King," Lindboe wrote in a
OL,19,Ftribute to the late king on Instagram.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
